{"id":"mira","lemma":"mira","pos":"noun","rank":117,"glosses":["target","purpose, object","sight (of a weapon)"],"ipa":"/ˈmiɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"miras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-mira.wav","formAudio":{"miras":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-miras.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Mira para otro lado.","en":"Look away.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/439123"},{"text":"¿Por qué me miras?","en":"Why are you looking at me?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/107469"},{"text":"Mira desde más cerca.","en":"Look closer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/439114"},{"text":"Si miras alrededor, verás a muchas personas haciendo lo mismo.","en":"If you look around, you'll see many people doing the same thing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77913"},{"text":"Mira por dónde caminas.","en":"Mind your step.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734360"}]}